WEBVTT

00:00:03.203 --> 00:00:07.304
Open Interaction Center, Management, Manage Activities.

00:00:07.304 --> 00:00:10.799
Every open activity is listed, not only yours.

00:00:10.799 --> 00:00:15.909
Each row shows whether it is manual or automated work, its source, the

00:00:15.909 --> 00:00:18.733
campaign, and who it is assigned to.

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:21.246
Open the filter panel.

00:00:21.246 --> 00:00:24.043
Contact filters find the people:

00:00:24.043 --> 00:00:30.152
their status, phone number, time zones, or when they were marked Do not call.

00:00:30.152 --> 00:00:33.022
Activity filters narrow the work:

00:00:33.022 --> 00:00:42.222
attempts, subject, channel, source, interaction type, status, assignment, campaign, urgency, dates, owners and a limit.

00:00:42.222 --> 00:00:46.785
Here, the subject Test Drive Follow-up and High urgency.

